<title>USA: Globalstar sets $500 mln debt w/warrants.</title>
<headline>Globalstar sets $500 mln debt w/warrants.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from Globalstar L.P. was priced in the private placement market on Thursday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size by $250 million. It was priced with warrants for 1.78 percent of the company, the source said.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER GLOBALSTAR L.P.</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 11.375 PCT MATURITY 2/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/97 LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 11.375 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 511 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
